>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (formula, assignment, and satisfaction data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SigmaElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SigmaElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}free}\\vdash \\mathrm{QF}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq Q\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in Q\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in Q\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in Q)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}free}\\vdash \\mathrm{QF}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq Q\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in Q\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in Q\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in Q)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}pi\\text{-}zero}\\vdash \\Sigma_0^{\\mathcal L}=\\Pi_0^{\\mathcal L}=\\mathrm{QF}(\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}pi\\text{-}zero}\\vdash \\Sigma_0^{\\mathcal L}=\\Pi_0^{\\mathcal L}=\\mathrm{QF}(\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}pi\\text{-}successor}\\vdash \\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\begin{aligned}\\Sigma_{m+1}^{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\exists v_0\\cdots\\exists v_{k-1}\\,\\varphi:k\\in\\omega\\land\\varphi\\in\\Pi_m^{\\mathcal L}\\},\\\\\\Pi_{m+1}^{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\forall v_0\\cdots\\forall v_{k-1}\\,\\varphi:k\\in\\omega\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_m^{\\mathcal L}\\}.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}pi\\text{-}successor}\\vdash \\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\begin{aligned}\\Sigma_{m+1}^{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\exists v_0\\cdots\\exists v_{k-1}\\,\\varphi:k\\in\\omega\\land\\varphi\\in\\Pi_m^{\\mathcal L}\\},\\\\\\Pi_{m+1}^{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\forall v_0\\cdots\\forall v_{k-1}\\,\\varphi:k\\in\\omega\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_m^{\\mathcal L}\\}.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}substructure}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4SigmaElementarySubstructure}_S(M,N,\\mathcal L,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(M,N,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathcal L}\\;\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to(M\\models\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow N\\models\\varphi[s])\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}substructure}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4SigmaElementarySubstructure}_S(M,N,\\mathcal L,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(M,N,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathcal L}\\;\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to(M\\models\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow N\\models\\varphi[s])\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The locally defined hierarchy uses canonical prenex codes; the empty quantifier block includes the preceding level.</li>\n<li>Assignments into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> are also assignments into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> because the substructure predicate includes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"563f382027630287","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":